WEBVTT

00:00:03.349 --> 00:00:04.008
1

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:07.206
<b>Open</b> the door. <b>Turn</b> right.

00:00:08.937 --> 00:00:11.096
<b>Don’t worry</b>. <b>Don’t stop</b>.

00:00:13.307 --> 00:00:16.207
<b>Be quiet</b>, please. Please <b>sit down</b>.

00:00:17.971 --> 00:00:18.622
2

00:00:19.725 --> 00:00:22.155
<b>Let’s go</b> home. <b>Let’s not</b> stop.